<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-JAPAN AND SOUTH KOREA DRAW 1-1 IN FRIENDLY MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JAPAN AND SOUTH KOREA DRAW 1-1 IN FRIENDLY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan and South Korea drew 1-1 (halftime 0-0) on Wednesday in a friendly match to celebrate the two nation's co-hosting of the 2002 World Cup finals.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>South Korea - Sang Chul-yoo (56)</p>
<p>Japan - Kazuyoshi Miura (88)</p>
